{
  "_note": "State-level snapshot for a personal law-school shortlist, covering all 50 states plus DC. Scores are 1-5 percentile ranks computed across all 51 jurisdictions, so they answer 'where does this rank' rather than 'what is the absolute value' \u2014 the raw figures next to them carry the magnitude. Cost of living and housing are C2ER index values published by MERIC (US avg = 100, Q2 2026). Lawyer job density and average legal salary are BLS OEWS May 2025 (occupation 23-1011). violentCrimeRate is the FBI's 2025 estimate per 100,000 (Crime in the United States, Table 4, released August 2026); safety is its quintile, inverted. lifeExpectancy is CDC/NCHS life expectancy at birth, 2022 (U.S. State Life Tables, NVSR 74-12, December 2025); healthcare is its quintile. Quintiles: percentile rank with ties at the midpoint, 10/10/10/10/11 states per band. livability/climate is an editorial 1-5. The youthful-active-lifestyle factor lives at the CITY level in cities.json and is shown on each school. Point-in-time \u2014 spot-check before relying on any number. Editable.",
